Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:14.80,0:05:15.12,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そう？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.29,0:05:17.08,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}よく分からない
