Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.67,0:05:29.49,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ヒッカリ〜！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.39,0:05:31.26,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}おべんと食べよっ
